    "narrative": "The Austin Waves are looking for elite production in a favorable schedule today, headlined by **Kyle Tucker** (80.08) and **Jackson Merrill** (75.10). **Kyle Tucker** remains our most reliable asset, benefiting from a soft matchup against Singer; his projection is bolstered significantly by a +14% adjustment for the opposing pitcher's profile and a +6% bump from his high-leverage spot in the third slot of the order. Meanwhile, **Jackson Merrill** is a high-upside play against Gordon. His 75.10 score is heavily driven by a +14% park factor and a +13% platoon advantage, positioning him as an elite offensive engine for this slate.\n\nThe most difficult decision for today's lineup involved the benching of **Henry Bolte**. With a score of 39.65, **Henry Bolte** narrowly missed our 40.0 efficiency floor, losing value due to a challenging matchup against Rasmussen, whose 3.30 xERA forces a -17% penalty to our base projections. While we value the speed potential of players like **Henry Bolte** and **Nasim Nunez** in our quest to win the stolen base category, we must prioritize game cap preservation when the pitcher matchup is this daunting. Similarly, **Miguel Vargas** remains a strong start at 59.41, as his base projection is elevated by a +10% SP skill edge and a specific focus on Valdez's slower delivery, which historically increases the likelihood of stolen base opportunities\u2014a critical factor for our team's roster construction.\n\nInvestors should remain cautious regarding the lower-scoring end of our active lineup. **Liam Hicks** (45.58) and **Luis Lara** (43.71) are currently hovering near our \"marginal\" threshold. **Liam Hicks** is facing a relatively high-xERA opponent in Springs, but the dynamic platoon disadvantage (-11%) keeps his ceiling capped. We are keeping a close watch on these margins as we manage our remaining game caps, ensuring that stars like **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** and **Gunnar Henderson** are preserved for matchups where their impact is maximized. We will monitor the remaining lineup reports for any late weather shifts, but as it stands, our focus is on riding the momentum of **Kyle Tucker** and **Jackson Merrill** to secure gains in the Roto standings.",
